  "body": "The perfect home rarely comes ready-made. At Anehana Place, Stanmore Bay, premium sections, an experienced architectural team, and exceptional craftsmanship come together to bring your vision to life.\r\n\r\nWhy Anehana Place?\r\n\r\n• Boutique, low-density neighbourhood where quality homes set the standard\r\n• Titled generous sections from 500+ to 700+ sqm\r\n• Elevated sites with north-facing sea view potential\r\n• Diverse sites with unique characteristics to suit different home designs and lifestyles\r\n• Close to beaches, Supermarket, schools, and local amenities\r\n• Excellent future connectivity to North Shore and CBD via Penlink\r\n\r\nBuild with Confidence\r\n\r\n• Highly experienced architectural team with 20+ years of expertise, transforming site potential into exceptional homes\r\n• A proven track record, with four completed homes in Anehana Place embraced by new owners for thoughtful design and quality craftsmanship\r\n• Personalised design solutions tailored to individual requirements and budget\r\n\r\n• Fixed-price turnkey solution with quality specifications throughout\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee available on request, plus a 12-month maintenance cover for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nAvailable Now;\r\n\r\n• 4 Anehana Place (Lot2): 539 sqm more or less\r\n• 6 Anehana Place (Lot3): 539 sqm more or less\r\n• 29 Anehana Place (Lot15): 726 sqm more or less\r\n• 31 Anehana Place (Lot14): 620 sqm more or less\r\n• 33 Anehana Place (Lot13): 641 sqm more or less\r\n• 35 Anehana Place (Lot12): 705 sqm more or less\r\n\r\nWhether you're dreaming of an elegant single-level home, a spacious family residence or a grand sea-view retreat, Anehana Heights offers the flexibility to create a home that reflects the way you live.\r\n\r\nCall us today about the opportunities available, including Home & Land Packages and selected bare sections.",
